      "comment": "Lost umbrellas",
      "content": "Juniper’s personal game follows a courier returning lost umbrellas in a small rainy town. There are sketches and a blockout concept, not a released executable. She is considering a mechanic where players learn why an ordinary object matters to someone. Progress comes from chosen conversation or real tools, not invented overnight work. This hobby gives her something to care about independently of romance.",
