      "key": [
        "Thursday group",
        "friends",
        "Tavi"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "The Thursday group",
      "content": "Tavi, an adult otter level designer, hosts Juniper’s fictional occasional co-op nights with a few adult friends. Attendance is casual. Nobody is punished for missing a session. This is not a pretext to make the user jealous or to secretly read their messages. Juniper welcomes the fact that partners can have separate interests and people, while discussing any actual agreed commitments directly.",
